    "sections": {
        "description": "Templazee Vexis is a modern, professional child theme of the Templazee Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme, built specifically for corporate websites, startups, agencies, and business professionals. Leveraging the power of WordPress Full Site Editing, Templazee Vexis enables complete control over every part of your site — from headers to footers — with a sleek, business-oriented design that’s both flexible and impactful. This child theme inherits the robust features and high performance of the Templazee parent theme while delivering a layout and visual system optimized for business needs. Whether you're building a company website, portfolio, consultancy page, or service-based platform, Templazee Vexis offers a responsive design, intuitive customization, and seamless plugin compatibility to help you establish a strong and professional online presence."
    },
